{
	"_readme": [
		"Hand-kept: which cars (slugs in seeds/cars.json) each EU type-approval variant can be, by registry make.",
		"Decided variant by variant from the EEA CO2 monitoring figures for the cars registered in Iceland",
		"(motor power, WLTP range and consumption, mass) and the names they are registered under.",
		"A variant lists several cars where the registry data cannot tell them apart: other model years, a second",
		"body style, or options such as a DC inlet or a CCS adapter. plate-match.ts narrows those by name and year",
		"and the owner picks among what is left. A variant that is not listed here narrows nothing.",
		"Variant codes are keyed as in seeds/registry-variants.json. Nissan is left out on purpose: its codes",
		"repeat across models and batteries, and its registered names state the battery (LEAF 40KWH)."
	],
